        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-29T22:22:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<blockquote>\nThey could easily hit the 200K if they also offered every SotM product as an add on, but that isn'y what they want.\n</blockquote>\nMakes sense. &nbsp;Why would they want $200k... ?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Why sell Sentinels through Kickstarter when they can sell it at Gencon or Essen or direct from their webstore and avoid having to pay Kickstarter a cut?</p>",
