        "created_at": "2013-04-29T23:10:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We were talking about the GSF Kickstarter at that point, about how it would get a huge goose from cross-promoting with SotM stuff. &nbsp;I have to admit that I think the philosophical question of whether or not GSF can stand on its own is an interesting one, but if you could get $200k for GSF by tossing some SotM stuff into its Kickstarter, that seems like a no brainer to me.</p>",
