        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-30T00:06:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We were talking about the GSF Kickstarter at that point, about how it would get a huge goose from cross-promoting with SotM stuff. &nbsp;I have to admit that I think the philosophical question of whether or not GSF can stand on its own is an interesting one, but if you could get $200k for GSF by tossing some SotM stuff into its Kickstarter, that seems like a no brainer to me.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well, I'm not convinced that they'd sell enough extra copies of GSF in order to make up for the loss incurred by selling Sentinels products via Kickstarter instead of their online store.</p>",
